--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 95847929271290341bb73bbda3eeeffc, type: 3}
  m_Name: George_Dialogue1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueAsset
  dialogueId: 
  lines:
  - speaker: Ran
    text: "Excuse me, sir\u2026 do you know anything about a golden key?\nIt\u2019s
      supposed to be connected to the castle."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fac10aea3c7ad4f47ad6a5085edd602f, type: 3}
  - speaker: George
    text: "Heh. A golden key?\nKid, in this world, anything shiny is either stolen\u2026
      or cursed. Which one are you hoping for?"
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d34783ae0c34f8e43ab3a7d14dcda8f4, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ran
    text: "I\u2019m serious. I need it."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 35d3ece786d1fa14cb0fb0d04aa4b843, type: 3}
  - speaker: George
    text: "You look serious.\nThat\u2019s your first mistake."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d34783ae0c34f8e43ab3a7d14dcda8f4, type: 3}
  - speaker: George
    text: "Yeah\u2026 I\u2019ve heard of your key.\nBig thing. Heavy. Gold like a
      king\u2019s lie.\nBut it\u2019s not lying around waiting for children with
      brave faces."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d34783ae0c34f8e43ab3a7d14dcda8f4, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ran
    text: So you do know where it is?
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 291ae8d5c5a7512459f5b5e13e0be914, type: 3}
  - speaker: George
    text: "I know where it might be.\nThat\u2019s different.\nTruth is a slippery
      thing \u2014 like me after my third bottle."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d34783ae0c34f8e43ab3a7d14dcda8f4, type: 3}
  - speaker: George
    text: "The key is in bad hands.\nHands that don\u2019t wash.\nBandits. They\u2019ve
      been sniffing around the old quarry past the dead oak."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d34783ae0c34f8e43ab3a7d14dcda8f4, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ran
    text: Then tell me how to get it.
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fac10aea3c7ad4f47ad6a5085edd602f, type: 3}
  - speaker: George
    text: " Oh, I will. But nothing\u2019s free, little hero. They took something
      from me too. A book."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d34783ae0c34f8e43ab3a7d14dcda8f4, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ran
    text: A book?
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 35d3ece786d1fa14cb0fb0d04aa4b843, type: 3}
  - speaker: George
    text: " Not just a book. My book.  Old leather cover. Worn corners. Smells like
      dust and regret. It\u2019s the only thing I\u2019ve got left that remembers
      who I used to be."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d34783ae0c34f8e43ab3a7d14dcda8f4, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ran
    text: You want me to bring it back?
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fac10aea3c7ad4f47ad6a5085edd602f, type: 3}
  - speaker: George
    text: "You catch on fast for someone your size.  Bring me the book. And I\u2019ll
      tell you exactly where they\u2019re hiding the key\u2026 and how not to die
      trying."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d34783ae0c34f8e43ab3a7d14dcda8f4, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ren
    text: Deal.
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fac10aea3c7ad4f47ad6a5085edd602f, type: 3}
  - speaker: George
    text: 'Careful with that word, boy.

      Deals shape a man more than battles
      do.'
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d34783ae0c34f8e43ab3a7d14dcda8f4, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ran
    text: "I\u2019ll bring it back."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fac10aea3c7ad4f47ad6a5085edd602f, type: 3}
  - speaker: George
    text: "We\u2019ll see."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d34783ae0c34f8e43ab3a7d14dcda8f4, type: 3}
  - speaker: George
    text: 'The bandits camp in the quarry east of the broken bridge. They keep their
      loot in a locked crate inside a collapsed storage shack. Your book should be
      there. '
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d34783ae0c34f8e43ab3a7d14dcda8f4, type: 3}
  - speaker: George
    text: " If you\u2019re lucky\u2026 they\u2019ll underestimate you.  If you\u2019re
      smart\u2026 you\u2019ll let them. "
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d34783ae0c34f8e43ab3a7d14dcda8f4, type: 3}
  endActions:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 05a395f0006c8ea4ba515394b5bf3e49, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 496bc5954a493da42af7b184eb8c1442, type: 2}
